/****************************************************************************
** Qt DynamicDashboard documentation
****************************************************************************/

/*!
    \page index.html
    \title Qt DynamicDashboard

    \brief A reusable, data-driven dashboard library for Qt Quick and QML.

    Qt DynamicDashboard provides an embeddable dashboard interface, QML
    components, C++ data models, data loading helpers, chart items, and report
    generation facilities for Qt Quick applications.

    The QML module URI is \c Dashboard and the module version is \c 1.0.

    \section1 Documentation

    \list
        \li \l {getting-started.html}{Getting Started}
        \li \l {qml-module.html}{Dashboard QML Module}
        \li \l {cpp-api.html}{C++ API}
        \li \l {data-handling.html}{Data Handling}
        \li \l {reporting.html}{Reporting}
        \li \l {examples.html}{Example Applications}
    \endlist

    \section1 Requirements

    The library requires Qt 6.8 or newer, CMake 3.21 or newer, and a C++17
    capable compiler. Building all example applications currently requires
    Qt 6.10 or newer.

    The library uses Qt Core, Qml, Quick, Quick Controls 2, Quick Dialogs 2,
    Network, and Sql.

    \section1 Source Code

    The source code is available at
    \l{https://github.com/mbr1376/DashboardPluginQml}{GitHub}.
*/
